{"articleNo":"471931","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=471931&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] [공사 안내] 글로벌관, 학생회관 노후 승강기 교체 공사 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2024.01.05","hit":"5966","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b>◇ 공 사 안 내 ◇</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">승강기 안전사고 예방 및 이용자 편의성 향상을 위하여</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">노후 승강기 교체공사를 시행하오니 이용에 불편하시더라도 양해바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ▶&nbsp;교체대상 : <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">① 글로벌관 중앙 승강기 11호기, 12호기</span></b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">② 학생회관 승강기 8</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">호기</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;공사기간 : <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2024. 1. 25.(목) ~ 2024. 3. 3</span></b></span><b style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.(일)</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;협조사항 : 공사기간 중 글로벌관 서관(9호기) 및 북관(10호기) 승강기 이용 가능,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 학생회관 승강기는 이용 불가하므로 계단 이용 요청</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;공사문의 : 시설안전과 (☎ 478-7142)</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
